    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "25 Fairway Drive is an exceptional residence combining refined comfort with the relaxed charm of Rosslare Strand. Set within one of the area’s most desirable neighbourhoods, this beautifully presented ground floor apartment off\u001ders contemporary living in one of the most sought after coastal destinations in the South East.\r\nA bright, welcoming entrance hall leads to a fully fitted modern kitchen featuring quality appliances and excellent storage. To the rear, the spacious open plan living and dining area forms the heart of the home, filled with natural light and opening directly onto a private beautifully landscaped south facing patio and garden area — an ideal space for outdoor dining, quiet mornings, or entertaining. Two generous double bedrooms provide calm, comfortable retreats, complemented by a modern wet room bathroom designed for convenience and accessibility.\r\nThe location is outstanding within walking distance to all the wonderful facilities Rosslare Strand has to off\u001der. Rosslare Strand’s renowned Blue Flag beach, acclaimed restaurants, boutique hotels, the golf club, The Burrow, shops, schools, and the train station are all within easy access, Wexford Town centre is approx.. 15km away, while Rosslare Europort is a 10 minute drive. Excellent road links via the N/M11 and N25 place Dublin City and Airport are 2hours approx. Whether you’re seeking a permanent home, a coastal getaway, or a quality investment in one of Ireland’s most sought after seaside destinations, this property off\u001ders style, comfort, and an enviable lifestyle.\r\nVIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Property Accommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall -(3.2m × 1.4m), Tiled floor, electric radiator, fuse box.\r\nKitchen – (3.2m × 2.2m), Tiled floor, eye & waist level cabinets, quartz countertop, hob with overhead extractor fan, raised oven & microwave, electric radiator, integrated appliances including a ‘Fisher and Paykel’ dishwasher & ‘Hotpoint’ pull out fridge.\r\nSitting Room/ Dining Room – (5.2m × 4.5m), Carpet floor, tv point, French door to garden, electric radiator.\r\nStorage closet – (2.9m × 1.1m), With ample storage.\r\nBedroom 1 – (3.1m × 4m), With a carpet floor and electric radiator.\r\nBedroom 2 – (3.2m × 3.3m), With a carpet floor and electric radiator.\r\nBathroom –  (1.9 m × 2m) Tiled floor, part tiled walls, WC, WHB, extractor fan, overhead rain shower, heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nOutside: Patio area, landscaped garden, parking\r\nServices: Mains water, mains sewage, electric heating throughout\r\nBER: C1 Ber No: 106467418 Performance indicator: 169.61 kWh/m2/yr\r\nApply: Keane Auctioneers (053) 9123072\r\nViewing: Strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime coastal location in Rosslare Strand.\r\nBright open plan living with south facing garden.\r\nModern fitted kitchen with quality appliances.\r\nTwo double bedrooms and a contemporary wet room.\r\nWalking distance to beach, dining, and transport.\r\nC. 75.69 m²"
      },
